                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If it has an independent clause and one or more subordinate clauses, it is complex:",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                116,
                768,
                142
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 1,
            "group_id": 2,
            "global_block_id": 2,
            "global_group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    116.0
                ],
                [
                    768.0,
                    116.0
                ],
                [
                    768.0,
                    142.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    142.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "While there are many good dictionaries, subordinate clause",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                154,
                539,
                180
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 3,
            "global_block_id": 3,
            "global_group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    114.0,
                    154.0
                ],
                [
                    539.0,
                    154.0
                ],
                [
                    539.0,
                    180.0
                ],
                [
                    114.0,
                    180.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "the greatest is the Oxford English Dictionary. independent clause",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                192,
                570,
                218
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 4,
            "global_block_id": 4,
            "global_group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    116.0,
                    192.0
                ],
                [
                    570.0,
                    192.0
                ],
                [
                    570.0,
                    218.0
                ],
                [
                    116.0,
                    218.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If it has at least two independent clauses, and at least one of them includes a sub-ordinate clause, it is compound-complex.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                233,
                770,
                283
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 5,
            "global_block_id": 5,
            "global_group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    233.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    233.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    283.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    283.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "These terms are potentially misleading, however, because they suggest that a grammatically simple sentence should also feel simpler than one that is grammatically complex. But that's not always true. For example, to most readers of the next two sentences, the grammatically simple one feels more complex than the grammatically complex one:",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                286,
                772,
                415
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 6,
            "global_block_id": 6,
            "global_group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    286.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    286.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    415.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    415.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Grammatically simple:</td><td>Our review of the test led to our modification of it as a result of complaints by teachers.</td></tr><tr><td>Grammatically complex:</td><td>After we reviewed the test, we modified it because teachers complained.</td></tr></table>",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                447,
                758,
                552
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": null,
            "group_id": 7,
            "global_block_id": 7,
            "global_group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    116.0,
                    447.0
                ],
                [
                    758.0,
                    447.0
                ],
                [
                    758.0,
                    552.0
                ],
                [
                    116.0,
                    552.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We need another set of terms that more reliably indicate how readers are likely to respond to such sentences.",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                588,
                771,
                640
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 8,
            "global_block_id": 8,
            "global_group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    588.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    588.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    640.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    640.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Punctuated and Grammatical Sentences",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                665,
                580,
                695
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 9,
            "global_block_id": 9,
            "global_group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    665.0
                ],
                [
                    580.0,
                    665.0
                ],
                [
                    580.0,
                    695.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    695.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We can make a more useful distinction between what we will call punctuated sentences and grammatical sentences:",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                708,
                770,
                760
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 10,
            "global_block_id": 10,
            "global_group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    708.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    708.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    760.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    760.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- A punctuated sentence begins with a capital letter and ends with a period, question mark, or exclamation point. It might be one word or more than a hundred.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                773,
                771,
                848
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 11,
            "global_block_id": 11,
            "global_group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    117.0,
                    773.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    773.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    848.0
                ],
                [
                    117.0,
                    848.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- A grammatical sentence is a subject and verb in a main clause along with everything else depending on that clause.",
            "block_bbox": [
                117,
                856,
                771,
                908
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 12,
            "global_block_id": 12,
            "global_group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    117.0,
                    856.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    856.0
                ],
                [
                    771.0,
                    908.0
                ],
                [
                    117.0,
                    908.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We distinguish these two kinds of sentence because readers respond to them very differently: the paragraph you are now reading is one long punctuated sentence, but it is not as difficult to read as many paragraphs made up of shorter sentences with multiple subordinate clauses; we have chosen to punctuate as one long sentence what might have been punctuated as a series of shorter ones: that semicolon, those colons, and the comma before but, for example, could have been periods—and that dash could have been a period too.",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                921,
                772,
                1100
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 13,
            "global_block_id": 13,
            "global_group_id": 13,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    78.0,
                    921.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    921.0
                ],
                [
                    772.0,
                    1100.0
                ],
                [
                    78.0,
                    1100.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Here is that long sentence you just read revised and repunctuated with virtually no change in its grammar, creating seven punctuated sentences:",
            "block_bbox": [
                79,
                1103,
                770,
                1155
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 14,
            "global_block_id": 14,
            "global_group_id": 14,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    79.0,
                    1103.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    1103.0
                ],
                [
                    770.0,
                    1155.0
                ],
                [
                    79.0,
                    1155.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "We distinguish these two kinds of sentence because readers respond to them very differently. The paragraph you are now reading is made up of short punctuated words.",
            "block_bbox": [
                93,
                1166,
                743,
